01:00:18.420 --> 01:00:29.340
It was just, don't look
to your career advancement.

01:00:29.340 --> 01:00:31.530
Yes, you might be
an ambitious person.

01:00:31.530 --> 01:00:34.140
But don't think about
everything in terms of,

01:00:34.140 --> 01:00:36.480
